{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build a thriving summer camp.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330570/extras/beach.gif?t=1748627377\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>Camplandia</strong>! In this charming 2D build-em-up, you're tasked with creating and managing your very own summer camp. From designing cozy cabins to planning exciting activities, every decision you make shapes the success and reputation of your camp. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330570/extras/SteamBanner.png?t=1748627377\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Keep your campers happy and healthy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330570/extras/foundation.gif?t=1748627377\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start by constructing essential facilities. The campers are going to need beds to sleep in, showers to stay clean, and a cafeteria to keep their bellies full. But meeting their basic needs is just the beginning. Organize fun activities to keep your campers entertained like fishing, kayaking, and campfires. Hire staff to handle cooking, cleaning, and keep everything running smoothly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330570/extras/SteamBanner.png?t=1748627377\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bring your dream summer camp to life.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330570/extras/eating.gif?t=1748627377\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Provide unforgettable experiences to earn glowing reviews and grow your camp. Whether you build by the beach, deep in the forest, or atop a snowy mountain, unlock new technologies and customize every detail to reflect your vision. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330570/extras/SteamBanner.png?t=1748627377\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Will you build a summer camp paradise\u2026 or end up with a bug-infested disaster?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330570/extras/camp.gif?t=1748627377\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2330570?t=1748627377","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2330570?t=1748627377","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330570/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748627377","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330570/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748627377","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build a thriving summer camp.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"h